	(text_box "Voltage Divider Sources: \n- Full scale analog output level on CS4363: 3.5V (page 27 of link:https://statics.cirrus.com/pubs/proDatasheet/CS4364_F1.pdf)\n- Full scale analog output level is in mArms so using the Absolute Maximum ratings for DC Power Supply (since the headroom of the output can't go above that): -0.3V to 4.32 V (page 8 of link:https://statics.cirrus.com/pubs/proDatasheet/CS4364_F1.pdf) "
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 168.91 83.82 0)
		(size 114.3 15.24)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
